# [S5-01] Python build/tool artefacts. Scoped to this app rather than added to the root
# .gitignore, which is outside this boot's boundary.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers .env, __pycache__/, *.pyc, .venv/ and venv/. mypy and
# pytest write a self-ignoring .gitignore into their own cache directories, so those need
# nothing here; an editable install's egg-info does.
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
